[h1]Questions[/h1]
Ask anything about Palpedia Enhancer here: how a feature works, whether something is possible, compatibility with another mod, install trouble that is not a bug. One question per reply keeps answers easy to find. Bugs go in the Bug Reports thread, ideas in the Suggestions thread.

[h2]Already answered[/h2]
[list]
    [*][b]Does it work in co-op or on dedicated servers?[/b] Yes. It is entirely client-side; nobody else needs it and nothing is sent to the server.
    [*][b]Controller?[/b] No. UE4SS mods need keyboard and mouse.
    [*][b]Game Pass / Microsoft Store?[/b] Not supported. Steam only.
    [*][b]Where are the settings?[/b] [noparse]Steam\steamapps\workshop\content\1623730\3788253343\Assets\Settings.ini[/noparse]. It is replaced on every update, so keep a copy of your changes.
    [*][b]Can I change the Ctrl+N hotkey?[/b] Yes: ToggleUnreadKey in Settings.ini. A-Z, 0-9, F1-F12, with optional Ctrl+ / Shift+ / Alt+. None unbinds it.
    [*][b]What does Ranch search do?[/b] It lists only Pals that produce the typed item when assigned to a ranch. Drops search covers what a Pal drops when caught or defeated.
    [*][b]Is there a Nexus Mods version?[/b] Yes, same mod and version, packaged for a UE4SS installed from Nexus instead of the Workshop. Pick one, not both.
    [*][b]The mod says it turned itself off after a Palworld update.[/b] That is on purpose: it protects your game until an update for the new build ships. Watch the Change Notes.
[/list]

[h2]When asking[/h2]
Say which version you run (Options > Mod Management) and, for install questions, whether UE4SS Experimental (Palworld) is subscribed and enabled and the game has been restarted since subscribing.
